{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2021-12-09 06:30:00', 'title': 'HENRY SCHEIN ANNOUNCES SUPPORT FOR 2021 TEAMSMILE PROGRAM', 'text': "MELVILLE, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HENRY SCHEIN, INC. (NASDAQ: HSIC) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS CONTINUED SUPPORT OF TEAMSMILE, A NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION THAT PROVIDES CHILDREN IN NEED A LIFE-CHANGING DENTAL EXPERIENCE THROUGH THE POWER OF SPORTS. FOR THIS YEAR'S PROGRAM, HENRY SCHEIN DENTAL, THE DENTAL BUSINESS OF HENRY SCHEIN, DONATED $30,000 IN CASH, NEARLY $40,000 IN DENTAL SUPPLIES AND PERSONAL PROTECTIVE EQUIPMENT, AS WELL AS TRANSPORTATION OF ALL MATERIALS TO AND FROM 18 PROGRAM SITES. IN ADDITIO"}